speechtext:
No. I have a press statement from the manager of the local employment office in Brandon to this effect;
Mr. Bain said a meeting to discuss Riding Mountain hiring methods was recently held in Ottawa at the instigation of local M.P. Walter Dinsdale. He said Mr. Dinsdale is quite concerned over charges that men are being hired for the project because of their political affiliation.
He said that steps were being taken to see that the national employment office is in charge of placing all workers hired at the Riding Mountain national park. That story appeared in the press some weeks ago.
